-atlas/pennsylvania/somerset-county"],["ARC or PLC in Somerset County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/somerset-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids shows August to September came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair fell to 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, while April to May ran 172% that year. On grid 23904 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 135.5, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
